            "content_html": "\u003cp\u003eWelcome to a resources page for bioinformatics research. Here you will find links for data, tools, tutorials, and related resources that may be helpful to your work.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"software-and-installations\" class=\"anchor-header\"\u003eSoftware and installations \u003ca class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#software-and-installations\" aria-label=\"Software and installations\"\u003e\n\u003csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"anchor-icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\n  \u003cpath stroke=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"/\u003e\n  \u003cpath d=\"M10 14a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 5 0l4 -4a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -5 -5l-.5 .5\" /\u003e\n  \u003cpath d=\"M14 10a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -5 0l-4 4a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 5 5l.5 -.5\" /\u003e\n\u003c/svg\u003e\n\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://posit.co/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eRStudio\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cran.rstudio.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eR Programming Language\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.python.org/downloads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003ePython Programming Language\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://mac.github.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eGit for Mac\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://windows.github.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eGit for Windows\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://git-scm.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eGit for all platforms\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.pythonforbiologists.org/\" target=\"_bl