ain\u0026rsquo;s Git and GitHub for Poets\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.digitalocean.com/community/tutorials/how-to-install-git-on-ubuntu-20-04\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eSetting Up Git on Linux\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://swcarpentry.github.io/git-novice/02-setup/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eSetting up Git\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/python/python-tutorial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eGetting Started with Python in VS Code\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://towardsthecloud.com/best-vscode-extensions-python\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e11 Best VS Code extensions for Python (2022)\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.ssh.com/ssh/keygen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eSSH keys\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qEPjUGQFmzQ\u0026amp;list=PLsYZRXov75ZHSwWiCk0-jd1RcTuu_-zmD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eLuman\u0026rsquo;s SSH keys video tutorial\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"tools-and-learning-links\" class=\"anchor-header\"\u003eTools and learning links \u003ca class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#tools-and-learning-links\" aria-label=\"Tools and learning links\"\u003e\n\u003csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"anchor-icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\n  \u003cpath stroke=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"/\u003e\n  \u003cpath d=\"M10 14a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 5 0l4 -4a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -5 -5l-.5 .5\" /\u003e\n  \u003cpath d=\"M14 10a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -5 0l-4 4a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 5 5l.5 -.5\" /\u003e\n\u003c/svg\u003e\n\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.biointeractive.org/classroom-resources/virus-explorer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eVirus Explorer\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://tcoffee.crg.cat/apps/tcoffee/tutorial.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eTCoffee tutorial\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TPRoLreU9lA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eHidden Markov Models (YouTube)\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://media.hhmi.org/biointeractive/films/Double_Helix.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eThe Double Helix (documentary, 17 mins)\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.biointeractive.org/classroom-resources/chemical-structure-dna\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eThe Chemical Structure of DNA\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o_-6JXLYS-k\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eThe Structure of DNA\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWZYpHSXvJo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eDefinition of 5\u0026rsquo; and 3\u0026rsquo; end of DNA (video)\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vP8-5Bhd2ag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eWhat happens when your DNA is damaged?\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BBI7GoIyoog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eMutations and Natural Selection\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NDIJexTT9j0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eProtein synthesis animation\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://www.lungendothelialcellatlas.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eLung Endothelial Cell Atlas\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://www.copdcellatlas.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eCOPD Cell Atlas\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://www.covidcellatlas.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eCOVID Cell Atlas\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://www.ipfcellatlas.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eIdiopathic Pulmonary Fibrosis Cell Atlas\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.kazusa.or.jp/codon/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eCodon Usage Database\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://card.mcmaster.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eComprehensive Antibiotic Resistance Database\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://card.mcmaster.ca/ontology/36514\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eermB anti resistance gene\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://web.expasy.org/sim/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eSIM alignment tool\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://card.mcmaster.ca/analyze\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eBlast analysis\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://www.diamondsearch.org/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eDiamond (BLAST alternative)\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://hmmer.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eHMMER\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://geneontology.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noope